---
import Jim from '@assets/img/jim.png'
---

<!-- NEW VERSION (09/02/2021) -->

<section id="jim">
  <h1 class="persona_title">Jim has a motor impairment</h1>
  <img src={Jim.src} class="stretch" alt="Jim" />
</section>

<section>
  <p>
    Jim cannot use a mouse.
    <br />
    He uses a{' '}
    <a target="tweede" href="https://youtu.be/Rz2HpGC9vbw?t=18">
      headstick
    </a>{' '}
    and a keyboard instead.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Try it yourself</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <kbd>Tab</kbd>: next interactive element
    </li>
    <li>
      <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>tab</kbd>: previous interactive element
    </li>
    <li>
      <kbd>Enter</kbd>: activate link or button
    </li>
    <li>
      <kbd>Spacebar</kbd>: select checkbox or radio button
    </li>
    <li>Up and down arrow keys: select list item</li>
  </ul>
  <!--
<p class="small"><a target="tweede" href="https://www.iana.org/domains/reserved">Example</a></p>
-->
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Example 1 - visible focus</h2>
  <p>Try to reach the following pages by using the tab key.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      "At a Glance" on{' '}
      <a
        target="tweede"
        href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/wcag/">
        W3C
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      "Top Promo" on{' '}
      <a target="tweede" href="https://www.collectandgo.be/colruyt/nl/home">
        Collect & Go
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Example 2 - drop-down menu</h2>
  <p>Try to expand the main menu without using the mouse.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a target="tweede" href="https://brussels-school.be/education">
        Brussels school of governance
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a target="tweede" href="https://www.kbc.be/retail/en.html?zone=topnav">
        KBC
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <!--<p>Other examples in case these ones stop working: , <a target="tweede" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/">Mozilla Developer Network (OK)</a></p>
-->
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Example 3 - accordions</h2>
  <p>
    Can you reach the accordion elements and expand them without using the
    mouse?
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a
        target="tweede"
        href="https://www.worldsoundtrackawards.com/awards/awards-2">
        World Soundtrack Awards
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a target="tweede" href="https://www.daenens.be/en/service-vouchers/faq">
        Daenens FAQ
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Best practice</h2>
  <p>
    Everything that's accessible by mouse must also be accessible by keyboard.
  </p>
</section>
